00:36:25,088 --> 00:36:26,022
KYLE.

888
00:36:26,022 --> 00:36:27,557
YOU KNOW WHAT
SHE REMINDS ME OF, GUYS?

889
00:36:27,557 --> 00:36:29,759
SHE REMINDS ME OF
A SOCIALITE'S DAUGHTER.

890
00:36:29,759 --> 00:36:32,495
WHICH IS ACTUALLY WHAT MODELING
USED TO BE IN ENGLAND

891
00:36:32,495 --> 00:36:35,465
BEFORE I CAME ALONG
IN THE MID '60s.

892
00:36:35,465 --> 00:36:37,033
I WAS THE FIRST
WORKING CLASS MODEL.

893
00:36:37,033 --> 00:36:39,035
WE DON'T SAY "WORKING CLASS,"
WE SAY "GHETTO."

894
00:36:39,035 --> 00:36:41,838
OH, WELL,
I'M GHETTO THEN.

895
00:36:41,838 --> 00:36:43,973
- TWIGGY GHETTO.
- KIM.

896
00:36:43,973 --> 00:36:45,275
YOU KNOW, WHEN YOU SAY
ABOUT SOME GIRLS

897
00:36:45,275 --> 00:36:46,809
THAT THEY DON'T
HAVE A BAD ANGLE?

898
00:36:46,809 --> 00:36:48,077
KIM DOES HAVE A BAD ANGLE.

899
00:36:48,077 --> 00:36:49,779
- LISA.
- THIS PICTURE OF LISA--

900
00:36:49,779 --> 00:36:53,883
I LOVE THE FLUIDITY OF HER BODY
RIGHT OFF THE PAGE.

901
00:36:53,883 --> 00:36:55,752
AND LISA'S COMPETITION--
MISS EBONY.

902
00:36:55,752 --> 00:36:56,986
IF THIS WAS HER
BEST PICTURE,

903
00:36:56,986 --> 00:36:58,922
I WOULD JUST HATE TO SEE
THE REST OF THE ROLL.

904
00:36:58,922 --> 00:37:00,690
EBONY LOOKS AS THOUGH
SHE NEEDS AN ENEMA.

905
00:37:00,690 --> 00:37:01,691
CORYN.

906
00:37:01,691 --> 00:37:04,160
I THINK SHE'S GOING FOR BEYONCE
AND SHE GETS RuPAUL.

907
00:37:04,160 --> 00:37:06,162
AND CORYN'S
COMPETITION-- SARAH.

908
00:37:06,162 --> 00:37:08,398
WHAT ABOUT SAINT JOHN'S
WHATEVER?

909
00:37:08,398 --> 00:37:12,101
OH, SAINT JOHN--
THE ADS FOR SAINT JOHN.

910
00:37:12,101 --> 00:37:12,702
BRE.

911
00:37:12,702 --> 00:37:14,504
I DON'T THINK BRE IS
BRINGING THAT PERSONALITY

912
00:37:14,504 --> 00:37:15,471
TO THE PHOTOGRAPHS.

913
00:37:15,471 --> 00:37:16,806
- NIK.
- HER SHAPE.

914
00:37:16,806 --> 00:37:19,208
HER BOTTOM AND EVERYTHING
IS GORGEOUS.

915
00:37:19,208 --> 00:37:21,344
KNICK KNACK, PADDY WHACK,
GIVE A GIRL A BUSTLE.

916
00:37:30,186 --> 00:37:31,688
THE JUDGES HAVE DELIBERATED.

917
00:37:33,156 --> 00:37:36,125
AND FOR EACH OF THE PAIRS
OF PHOTOGRAPHS,

918
00:37:36,125 --> 00:37:38,795
WE PICKED THE STRONGEST ONE,

919
00:37:38,795 --> 00:37:40,463
WHICH MEANS SIX OF YOU
DID WELL.

920
00:37:41,831 --> 00:37:44,634
AND WHEN YOU SEE
YOUR FACE ON THIS SCREEN

921
00:37:44,634 --> 00:37:46,235
IN THIS MAGAZINE LAYOUT,

922
00:37:46,235 --> 00:37:48,304
THAT MEANS THAT YOU WILL
STILL BE IN THE RUNNING

923
00:37:48,304 --> 00:37:51,174
TOWARDS BECOMING
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

924
00:37:54,844 --> 00:37:56,879
MISS CASSANDRA,
HAY STACK HONEY.

925
00:38:04,220 --> 00:38:05,855
CONGRATULATIONS.

926
00:38:05,855 --> 00:38:06,689
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING

927
00:38:06,689 --> 00:38:08,257
TOWARDS BECOMING AMERICA'S
NEXT TOP MODEL.

928
00:38:08,257 --> 00:38:09,292
THANK YOU.

929
00:38:12,528 --> 00:38:14,864
NICOLE.

930
00:38:14,864 --> 00:38:17,867
WORKING
THE PRETTY PEASANT PAGE.

931
00:38:17,867 --> 00:38:19,535
- CONGRATULATIONS.
- THANK YOU.

932
00:38:19,535 --> 00:38:21,304
CORYN.

933
00:38:21,304 --> 00:38:24,007
ROCKING THE RUSTIC RUFFLES.

934
00:38:24,007 --> 00:38:26,275
- CONGRATULATIONS, CORYN.
- THANK YOU.

935
00:38:26,275 --> 00:38:29,078
KIM, HUNTING
HABERDASHERIES.

936
00:38:29,078 --> 00:38:31,114
- YOU SEEM SAD, KIM.
- I'M JUST REALLY SURPRISED.

937
00:38:31,114 --> 00:38:32,715
SORRY.

938
00:38:32,715 --> 00:38:35,485
LISA, FARM HAND FATALES.

939
00:38:37,353 --> 00:38:38,588
CONGRATULATIONS.

940
00:38:39,922 --> 00:38:41,691
AND CLOSING OUT
OUR STORY IS NIK.

941
00:38:41,691 --> 00:38:43,059
COUNTRY COUTURE.

942
00:38:44,660 --> 00:38:46,429
- CONGRATULATIONS, NIK.
- THANK YOU.

943
00:38:46,429 --> 00:38:47,764
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING
TOWARDS BECOMING

944
00:38:47,764 --> 00:38:49,432
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

945
00:38:51,200 --> 00:38:54,570
SO SIX LADIES
STAND BEFORE ME.

946
00:38:54,570 --> 00:38:57,040
THE SIX WEAKEST PICTURES

947
00:38:57,040 --> 00:38:59,175
ARE WHAT YOU ALL
REPRESENT RIGHT NOW,

948
00:38:59,175 --> 00:39:01,844
WHICH MEANS ONE OF YOU
WILL GO HOME.

949
00:39:01,844 --> 00:39:04,881
THE FIRST NAME THAT
I'M GOING TO CALL--

950
00:39:04,881 --> 00:39:06,049
BRE.

951
00:39:08,084 --> 00:39:09,352
CONGRATULATIONS.

952
00:39:12,555 --> 00:39:14,624
JAYLA.

953
00:39:14,624 --> 00:39:15,925
CONGRATULATIONS.

954
00:39:19,762 --> 00:39:20,863
SARAH.

955
00:39:23,099 --> 00:39:24,200
CONGRATULATIONS, SARAH.

956
00:39:28,237 --> 00:39:30,706
THE NEXT NAME
THAT I'M GOING TO CALL...

957
00:39:33,776 --> 00:39:34,877
KYLE.

958
00:39:38,781 --> 00:39:40,483
- CONGRATULATIONS.
- THANK YOU.

959
00:39:40,483 --> 00:39:41,818
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING
TOWARDS BECOMING

960
00:39:41,818 --> 00:39:43,419
- AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.
- THANK YOU.

961
00:39:43,419 --> 00:39:44,620
YOU'RE WELCOME.

962
00:39:46,122 --> 00:39:48,124
WILL DIANE AND EBONY
PLEASE STEP FORWARD?

963
00:39:50,760 --> 00:39:54,497
I HAVE ONE PHOTO
IN MY HANDS,

964
00:39:54,497 --> 00:39:56,165
AND THIS PHOTO
REPRESENTS THE GIRL

965
00:39:56,165 --> 00:39:57,700
THAT WILL STILL BE
IN THE RUNNING

966
00:39:57,700 --> 00:40:00,470
TOWARDS BECOMING
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

967
00:40:02,738 --> 00:40:05,308
I WILL ONLY CALL ONE NAME.

968
00:40:05,308 --> 00:40:06,676
THE GIRL THAT I DO NOT CALL

969
00:40:06,676 --> 00:40:10,046
MUST IMMEDIATELY
RETURN TO THE HOUSE,

970
00:40:10,046 --> 00:40:12,682
PACK YOUR BELONGINGS
AND GO HOME.

971
00:40:14,851 --> 00:40:16,586
LET'S START WITH YOU, DIANE.

972
00:40:16,586 --> 00:40:19,288
THE JUDGES SEE
A GORGEOUS FACE.

973
00:40:19,288 --> 00:40:21,290
WE SEE THIS BEAUTIFUL BODY,

974
00:40:21,290 --> 00:40:22,191
BUT WE HAVEN'T SEEN

975
00:40:22,191 --> 00:40:25,428
THIS BEAUTIFUL BODY
CAPTURED IN A PHOTO.

976
00:40:25,428 --> 00:40:30,633
EBONY, YOU IMPRESSED ME
AT THE CASTINGS

977
00:40:30,633 --> 00:40:33,736
BECAUSE YOU WERE
SO OBSESSED WITH MODELING.

978
00:40:33,736 --> 00:40:37,707
BUT THE JUDGES ARE SEEING THAT
MAYBE IT'S JUST A DREAM.

979
00:40:45,281 --> 00:40:46,649
DIANE.

980
00:40:52,588 --> 00:40:54,657
DIANE,
WHERE'S THAT GIRL?

981
00:40:54,657 --> 00:40:56,425
I KNOW SHE'S THERE.

982
00:40:56,425 --> 00:40:58,794
- CONGRATULATIONS.
- THANK YOU SO MUCH.

983
00:40:58,794 --> 00:41:00,163
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING
TOWARDS BECOMING

984
00:41:00,163 --> 00:41:01,464
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

985
00:41:01,464 --> 00:41:02,999
THANK YOU.

986
00:41:04,567 --> 00:41:06,002
THANKS, EBONY.

987
00:41:07,470 --> 00:41:09,772
(crying)

988
00:41:28,424 --> 00:41:30,960
I'M SAD THAT I GOT
ELIMINATED.

989
00:41:30,960 --> 00:41:32,929
I'M HEARTBROKEN.

990
00:41:32,929 --> 00:41:35,298
MODELING WAS MY DREAM.

991
00:41:35,298 --> 00:41:37,533
IT'S HARD TO HEAR
THAT PEOPLE THINK,

992
00:41:37,533 --> 00:41:41,304
LIKE, THAT IT'S
JUST A DREAM.

993
00:41:41,304 --> 00:41:44,974
I'M TAKING THIS AS
A LEARNING EXPERIENCE.

994
00:41:44,974 --> 00:41:46,909
THEY CLOSED THE DOOR ON ME,
BUT THAT JUST MEANS

995
00:41:46,909 --> 00:41:48,778
I'M GONNA GO AND
KNOCK ON 20 OTHER ONES

996
00:41:48,778 --> 00:41:50,947
UNTIL SOMEONE SAYS YES.

997
00:41:50,947 --> 00:41:53,282
I THINK I'M DEFINITELY
GONNA BE OKAY.

998
00:41:53,282 --> 00:41:57,787
I JUST WALKED MY FIRST STEP
TOWARD BECOMING A TOP MODEL,

999
00:41:57,787 --> 00:42:00,523
AND I HAVE, LIKE, YOU KNOW,
A LOT MORE STEPS TO GO.

1000
00:42:28,050 --> 00:42:30,052
COMING UP ON
"AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL"--

1001
00:42:30,052 --> 00:42:32,121
A VISION IN FLIPPERS ARRIVES
TO TEACH THE GIRLS

1002
00:42:32,121 --> 00:42:33,356
ABOUT WORKING THE RUNWAY...

1003
00:42:33,356 --> 00:42:35,524
SHAKE IT BUT DON'T BREAK IT
'CAUSE THE BOYS WON'T TAKE IT.

1004
00:42:35,524 --> 00:42:38,261
- AND SARAH FIZZLES.
- SARAH, I NEED MORE NECK.

1005
00:42:38,261 --> 00:42:39,996
WHAT DO YOU MEAN?
I DON'T HAVE MORE NECK.

1006
00:42:39,996 --> 00:42:42,932
AS HER RELATIONSHIP WITH KIM
BEGINS TO SIZZLE.

1007
00:42:42,932 --> 00:42:45,067
IF I WAS HER GIRLFRIEND,
I'D BE LIKE, "ALL RIGHT, NOW,

1008
00:42:45,067 --> 00:42:46,402
EXPLAIN THAT."

